      "description": "Uses position_near_with_facing because this is a find/locate task. The player must navigate inside the building and get close enough to the blast_furnace (at spawn-relative -2, 1, 10) while facing it, confirming visual identification. max_distance=8 ensures the player is inside the building near the back wall, and facing_tolerance=60 ensures they are looking at it.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "type": "position_near_with_facing",
